# Normalize all text files to LF, both in the repository and on checkout
# (eol=lf, not just text=auto), regardless of a contributor's OS/editor or
# core.autocrlf setting. This is what keeps GitHub's diff view (and git
# diff locally) from ever showing a file as fully rewritten just because
# its line-ending convention changed.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Known binary types: never let Git attempt any text/line-ending conversion.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.ipynb binary
